Cell["\<\
For all these transcendental types, the generated exact numbers have been \
mathematically proven to be transcendental through the theorems of \
Lindemann-Weierstrass, Gelfond-Schneider and Baker (cf. Baker, 1975). They \
establish than any linear combination of the above types is a transcendental \
number.\
\>", "Notes",
 TaggingRules-><|
