Cell["\<\
It should be emphasized though that while these are easy computational \
investigations within the Wolfram Language, a proper rigorous mathematical \
proof is necessary to establish the transcendence character of a number (that \
is equivalent to evaluating it at infinite precision)[1].\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "ChatNotebookSettings" -> <|
    "InheritanceTest" -> True, 
     "ServiceDefaultModel" -> <|
      "LLMKit" -> Automatic, "OpenAI" -> "chatgpt-4o-latest", "Anthropic" -> 
       "claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929"|>, 
     "Model" -> <|
      "Service" -> "Anthropic", "Name" -> "claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929"|>, 
     "PersonaFavorites" -> {"CodeAssistant", "CodeWriter", "PlainChat"}, 
     "CurrentPreferencesTab" -> "Services", 
     "VisiblePersonas" -> {
      "CodeAssistant", "CodeWriter", "PlainChat", "RawModel"}, 
     "ToolSelections" -> <|
      "DocumentationLookup" -> <|
        "CodeAssistant" -> True, "CodeWriter" -> True|>, 
       "DocumentationSearcher" -> <|
        "CodeAssistant" -> True, "CodeWriter" -> True|>|>|>|>,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980826727029397*^9, 3.9808268380681543`*^9}, {
   3.980826922296733*^9, 3.980827097551641*^9}, {3.980827261837192*^9, 
   3.980827270817698*^9}, {3.980827465023951*^9, 3.980827471715794*^9}, {
   3.980827791665286*^9, 3.980827803477161*^9}, {3.981467272915483*^9, 
   3.98146727714424*^9}, {3.98838480687038*^9, 3.988384807529235*^9}, {
   3.988384963221046*^9, 3.9883849645513487`*^9}, {3.988386086361318*^9, 
   3.988386088065123*^9}, 
   3.989334142740654*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1b26991e-db5b-4268-8d9b-\
f240a1ea390f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "It is interesting to notice that according to G. Cantor's theory of \
infinity, transcendental numbers have higher cardinality - they are in a \
sense \"many more infinite\" - than algebraic numbers[2]. This intuitively \
agrees well also with S. Wolfram's fundamental result showing that \
computational systems more often exist as a result of the application of \
rules (or \"programs\" like ",
 ButtonBox["Exp",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Exp"],
 ") rather than due to the satisfaction of constraints (or \"equations\" like \
",
 ButtonBox["Root",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Root"],
 " internally) - cf. NKS Ch. 7, p. 342-350[3]."
}], "Text",
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988383768357778*^9, 3.988383774626732*^9}, {
   3.9883841990297613`*^9, 3.988384205637094*^9}, {3.9883844772275887`*^9, 
   3.98838468340933*^9}, {3.988384721231472*^9, 3.988385099874481*^9}, {
   3.9883852021329737`*^9, 3.9883852062139*^9}, {3.988385507030648*^9, 
   3.988385554830398*^9}, {3.9883861159574947`*^9, 3.988386148456958*^9}, {
   3.9883861863315897`*^9, 3.988386293592011*^9}, {3.9883863467009363`*^9, 
   3.988386347444666*^9}, {3.988386393757432*^9, 3.988386529023962*^9}, {
