   "TabNext"},ExpressionUUID->"5389b9b4-0a95-4e84-a243-779156c1411d"],

Cell["\<\
This second 1.1 version implements these theorems more generally than the \
first 1.0, but still not in the most efficient way. I hope to further refine \
this algorithm in later versions.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules->{},
 InitializationCell->True,
